{"rule":"fixed_jin036_complete_unit_close_kin","slot":"jie-mother"},"maternal_role_basis":"source_mother_appellation","role":"mother_unspecified","biological_mother":null,"father_person_id":null,"biological_motherhood_asserted":false},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017","quote":"玠字叔寶，年五歲，風神秀異。祖父瓘曰：「此兒有異于眾，顧吾年老，不見其成長耳！」總角乘羊車入市，見者皆以為玉人，觀之者傾都。驃騎將軍王濟，玠之舅也，俊爽有風姿，每見玠，輒歎曰：「珠玉在側，覺我形穢。」又嘗語人曰：「與玠同遊，冏若明珠之在側，朗然照人。」及長，好言玄理。其後多病體羸，母恆禁其語。遇有勝日，親友時請一言，無不咨嗟，以為入微。琅邪王澄有高名，少所推服，每聞玠言，輒歎息絕倒。故時人為之語曰：「衛玠談道，平子絕倒。」澄及王玄、王濟並有盛名，皆出玠下，世云「王家三子，不如衛家一兒。」玠妻父樂廣，有海內重名，議者以為「婦公冰清，女婿玉潤。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0141"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p018","quote":"闢命屢至，皆不就。久之，為太傅西閣祭酒，拜太子洗馬。璪為散騎侍郎，內侍懷帝。玠以天下大亂，欲移家南行。母曰：「我不能舍仲寶去也。」玠啟諭深至，為門戶大計，母涕泣從之。臨別，玠謂兄曰：「在三之義，人之所重。今可謂致身之日，兄其勉之。」乃扶輿母轉至江夏。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p018:m0038","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p018:m0051"}],"interpretation_note":"恆是常/一直之副詞，非母名/父衛恆；不給母取名恆或王氏。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0141","start":141,"end":142,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"3qy_ihs_lam","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p018:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"3qy_ihs_lam"